******** Case *********
Case          hunt

******** Mesh parameters *********
nx              40    // mesh points in x-direction
ny              30    // mesh points in y-direction
nz              30    // mesh points in z-direction

Lx            4.0    // domain size in x-direction
Ly            1.0    // domain size in y-direction
Lz            1.0    // domain size in z-direction

clusterX      1.0    // mesh clustering in x-direction
clusterY      1.8    // mesh clustering in y-direction
clusterZ      1.8    // mesh clustering in z-direction

******** Timestepping parameters ********
t_final       20.0     // final time-step
dt            0.01    // time-step
theta         0.6     // Theta-scheme parameter (0.5 to match Crank-Nicolson scheme in Li et al. (2019)).
vis_steps      5     // visualisation step frequency

******** Dimensionless parameters ********
Re            10.0    // Reynolds number
kappa         40.0      // Coupling number, kappa = Ha^2 / Re (often called N).

Bx            0.0     // Magnetic field (x-component)
By            0.0     // Magnetic field (y-component)
Bz            1.0     // Magnetic field (z-component)

alpha         0.0     // Grad-div (augmented Lagrangian) parameter

SaveDirectory auto   // Name of output directory (auto results in automatically generated name).
